---
description: Go test conventions for unit and HTTP adapter tests
globs: "**/*_test.go"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

- Domain/service tests: no Gin/GORM/Redis imports.
- HTTP: `NewRouter` + `httptest`; table-drive status + `error.code`.
- After route gen changes: `go test ./internal/adapters/inbound/http/...`
- Prefer file/package-scoped `go test` over full suite while iterating.
- Do not delete failing tests to green CI. Matrix: `docs/testing/`.
